+Throughout this section, all identities involving finite fermion operators are elementary statements within a finite-dimensional Hilbert space. Applying them to establish a complete bosonization dictionary remains a separate problem. There is currently no implemented Lean formalization for Chapter 20, and the results here are presented as unverified draft mathematics.
 
